    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6afdb5cda4a79edf137b5912</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afdb5cda4a79edf137b5912</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:36:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hello，快乐冠军们～</span></p><p><span>大家点播很久的《后会友期》来啦，话多不多，欢迎大家收听！</span></p><p><span>来小宇宙细品后会友期，欢迎点击：</span><a href="https://h5.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/xyz-activity/imissyou" data-url="https://h5.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/xyz-activity/imissyou"><span>后会友期观察室</span></a><span>，或者在小宇宙🔍「友情」，一键追更。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsrtSUy0mMiyyFVZ23a_X-FvBBc5.jpeg"><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> 来了来了，我们来聊《后会友期》了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 厉娜、许飞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 文吉儿、王子璇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4345">72:25</a> 张萌、马天宇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4965">82:45</a> 白小纯、青稚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6484">108:04</a> 为什么《后会友期》会这么火</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7202">120:02</a> 也有一些不满意想说给芒果</span></p><p><span>主播：</span></p><p><span>未来欣，媒体商务</span></p><p><span>锅锅，媒体人，</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/2975832013" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/2975832013"><span>wb@关雁北</span></a></p><p><span>叉叉，影视营销从业者，</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d1c83830000000012039cf6?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d1c83830000000012039cf6&amp;apptime=1732081123&amp;share_id=e83e6fec5d1d4697b5c1a436e674f476" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d1c83830000000012039cf6?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d1c83830000000012039cf6&amp;apptime=1732081123&amp;share_id=e83e6fec5d1d4697b5c1a436e674f476"><span>xhs@叉叉叉叉</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1705815550" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1705815550"><span>wb@张老刚</span></a></p><p><span>剪辑：阿鲸</span></p><p><span>音乐：wb@陈知游园惊梦</span></p><p><span>【关于找点乐子Plus2.0】</span></p><p><span>快乐冠军们，找点乐子2.0来啦！新一季，节目由双月更新调整成了一月一更，在每个月的一号会跟大家相见。欢迎新老朋友来购买收听，如果您是苹果用户，可点击</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast-topic/6a96b77376