    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一年一度的脱口秀节目又来啦！今年我们发挥人脉，请到了参赛选手兼小红书博主张骏来到快亚作客，听他聊聊关于讲脱口秀、做博主和比赛的故事。话不多说，欢迎收听~</span></p><p><span>shownotes：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 快乐亚军喜迎脱口秀演员张骏！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 脱口秀节目的入局门槛在变高</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> 在纽约换了一种新的生活方式，一定要有收获吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 对比赛没有预期，但张骏有个段子必须要在总决赛讲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">42:42</a> 张骏大爆料：他在美国得了痔疮！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2766">46:06</a> 原本张骏想在小红书做一个健身“擦边”男？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3361">56:01</a> 24小时追逐梦想是不健康的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3956">65:56</a> 脱口秀可讲的话题会越来越少吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4388">73:08</a> 身处比赛场直面输赢，能做到真正的拒绝比较吗？</span></p><p><span>主播：</span></p><p><span>未来欣，媒体商务</span></p><p><span>锅锅，媒体人，</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/2975832013" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/2975832013"><span>wb@关雁北</span></a></p><p><span>叉叉，影视营销从业者，</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d1c83830000000012039cf6?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d1c83830000000012039cf6&amp;apptime=1732081123&amp;share_id=e83e6fec5d1d4697b5c1a436e674f476" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d1c83830000000012039cf6?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d1c83830000000012039cf6&amp;apptime=1732081123&amp;share_id=e83e6fec5d1d4697b5c1a436e674f476"><span>xhs@叉叉叉叉</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1705815550" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1705815550"><span>wb@张老刚</span></a></p><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><p><span>张骏，脱口秀演员&amp;小红书博主，</span><a href="https://xhslink.cn/m/92VdbOsitMX" data-url="https://xhslink.cn/m/92VdbOsitMX"><span>xhs@张骏</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5997846680" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5997846680"><span>w